Subject: ocr core — LLM-free building blocks for an external review brain

Base: alibaba/open-code-review v1.13.8 (4236c87)
Adds the `ocr core` command group (diff, relocate, emit, rule, prompt, template,
tools, group, render). Every sub-command reuses engine internals so a host agent
(Claude Code via the open-code-review-local skill) reaches the same file
selection, grouping, prompts, line positions and output contract as `ocr review`.
No sub-command makes an LLM or network call.

Files: cmd/opencodereview/root.go (register), cmd/opencodereview/core_cmd*.go,
       internal/agent/core*.go
Reimplemented on v1.13.8 from the behaviour of the earlier v1.6.6+core build
(original source not available). Upstream does not ship this command group.

